('89b79a9d-1418-4d21-980a-4b1f39a7de85', 'Extended Side Angle Yoga Pose', 'Full Body', 'Bodyweight', '{"Full Body"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], 'Use this stretch to open up your full body area and enhance overall flexibility. Flexibility work like this enhances performance and prevents stiffness. Can be modified for beginners or progressed for advanced athletes. This exercise pairs well with complementary movements for balanced training.', '52541201', '52541201-Extended-Side-Angle-Yoga-Pose-(female)_Stretching_.mp4', 'female', FALSE, '2025-12-03 23:26:33.505723+00', '1. Move into the stretch position for Extended Side Angle Yoga Pose. 2. Ease into the stretch until you feel gentle tension (not pain). 3. Hold for 20-30 seconds, breathing deeply and relaxing into the stretch. 4. Switch sides and repeat for equal time.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 1, NULL, TRUE, NULL, 'Stretch', 15, 2, 6, FALSE, TRUE, 'yoga', 'Extended Side Angle Yoga Pose', 'stretch_hip, stretch_back, plank', FALSE, 'bodyweight', TRUE, 1, 30, 2, 70, 88, 95, 65),
